OL,3,GNEWSAPaddleboarder drowned after
OL,4,Arefusing lifejacket, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paddleboarder who refused to wear a
OL,7,Flifejacket drowned in a lake in Eryri
OL,8,FNational Park, an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FRowan Booth, 21, from Prestatyn,
OL,11,FDenbighshire, died on a visit to Llyn
OL,12,FGeirionnydd, above the Conwy Valley, on
OL,13,F7 July, after getting into difficulty
OL,14,Fin the water.
OL,16,FThe inquest at Ruthin Coroner's Court
OL,17,Fheard the group returned to the shore,
OL,18,Fbut Booth went out again on his own and
OL,19,Ffell off the paddleboard.
OL,21,FHis body was recovered after a
OL,22,Flarge-scale search by rescue teams.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
